OL,3,GNEWSAMan in court accused of caravan
OL,4,Apark murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has appeared in court charged
OL,7,Fwith the murder of a father-of-four at
OL,8,Fa caravan park.
OL,10,FLee Jackson, 40, sustained fatal
OL,11,Finjuries during an incident at the
OL,12,FValley Farm Holiday Park in
OL,13,FClacton-on-Sea, Essex, on 14 October.
OL,15,FDaniel Fox, 39, of Hampden Crescent,
OL,16,FWarley, is also accused of burglary,
OL,17,Ftwo offences of making threats to kill
OL,18,Fand three counts of assaulting an
OL,19,Femergency worker.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
