OL,3,GNEWSAMan in court accused of caravan
OL,4,Apark murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe spoke only to confirm his name when
OL,7,Fhe appeared via video link at
OL,8,FChelmsford Crown Court on 21 October.
OL,9,FHe was remanded in custody. A plea
OL,10,Fhearing has been set for 16 December.
